1. What this covers

This license covers SampQOL OS: the mpcqol.so module, the autorun and
helper scripts, the splash image, the screens, layouts and texts it adds
to an MPC Sample, and its manual and release notes ("SampQOL OS").

It does not cover the MPC Sample firmware or app. Those are the property
of inMusic Brands, Inc. SampQOL OS contains no part of them.

2. What you may do

- Use SampQOL OS on an MPC Sample that you own or may use.
- Use it for any purpose, including commercial work and live
  performance. What you make with it is yours.
- Study, decompile and modify SampQOL OS for your own use.

3. Sharing

SampQOL OS comes only from the official download:
https://github.com/snarebes/SampQOL-OS/releases
This way, every user gets the latest version and can check its SHA256.
Please share the link, not the files.

Without written permission, you may not:

- Upload, host or otherwise distribute SampQOL OS, or a modified
  version of it. A link to the official download is always OK.
- Sell, rent or charge for SampQOL OS or for access to it.
- Remove this license or any copyright notice, or present SampQOL OS
  as your own work.

Do you want to share a modified version or host a mirror? Ask me on
the GitHub page. I am happy to talk about it.

