The use of SampQOL OS can affect your warranty or support from inMusic
Brands, Inc.

5. Trademarks

SampQOL OS is not affiliated with, endorsed by or supported by inMusic
Brands, Inc. or Akai Professional. Akai Professional, MPC and MPC Sample
are trademarks of their owners.

Do not contact Akai Professional or inMusic support about SampQOL OS.
Before you ask them for help, remove the autorun folder from the card
and make sure that the problem also occurs on the stock MPC Sample.

